<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-8021] Destroyed caches can be return to life by restart grid</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-8021</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Cache configuration files stay stored on file system after invoke &lt;tt&gt;destroy&lt;/tt&gt; method.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;By the reason after restart grid all removed&#160;caches are start.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Look at the test&#160;&lt;span class=&quot;nobr&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/attachment/12915690/12915690_DstroedCacheReturnTest.java&quot; title=&quot;DstroedCacheReturnTest.java attached to IGNITE-8021&quot;&gt;DstroedCacheReturnTest.java&lt;sup&gt;&lt;img class=&quot;rendericon&quot; src=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/images/icons/link_attachment_7.gif&quot; height=&quot;7&quot; width=&quot;7&quot; align=&quot;absmiddle&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; border=&quot;0&quot;/&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
